WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,420
Help me book a flight to New York

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:06,040
Let's go to Alu tomorrow morning

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,230
It might as well have been Alu to her.

4
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,420
This way you will always be mine

5
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:20,190
No one can try to take away the debt. You are shaking. I'm fine. Is Sister Meng still alive?

6
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:25,090
The five hundred thousand that Mr. Lu asked me to give you is so much, Sister Meng.

7
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:26,690
Please help me deposit that card

8
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,100
Let Miss Jane eat on time

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,500
Don't tell her about death

10
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,500
antipyretics

11
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:37,570
How do you know Miss Jane has a fever?

12
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:39,370
Then how did you know that Miss Jian had a fever?

13
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:40,970
She got caught in the rain a while ago

14
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,770
That's a big chunk on your forehead, right?

15
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:49,280
I can see that fool even if I'm not blind

16
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,080
My heart is all about money

17
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,040
Not feeling well

18
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,440
The stitches on my forehead haven't been removed yet.

19
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,040
He came back and asked me if I had any work to do.

20
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,240
So you made arrangements for her

21
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,440
Today's life-threatening work
